106
00:05:17,090 --> 00:05:19,930
With just one prompt, Qwen got it done.

107
00:05:19,930 --> 00:05:21,270
And it looks really slick.

108
00:05:21,270 --> 00:05:25,050
You can also select a preset melody to play.

109
00:05:26,840 --> 00:05:28,640
