110
00:05:28,640 --> 00:05:32,360
Click to add notes.

111
00:05:33,560 --> 00:05:37,520
You can also choose from six different modes.

112
00:05:38,160 --> 00:05:42,520
I gotta say, the design quality of Qwen's front-end page this time is really impressive.

113
00:05:42,520 --> 00:05:45,470
This task was generated on Qwen Studio.

114
00:05:45,470 --> 00:05:47,850
And we didn't use any front-end optimization skills.

115
00:05:47,850 --> 00:05:49,610
