There are presets for a rainy alley, a harbor, and a rooftop. In the rainy alley preset, an umbrella moves from the left side of the screen to the right.

138
00:07:08,160 --> 00:07:09,880
The streetlights flicker erratically.

139
00:07:09,880 --> 00:07:17,220
